{"w":2400,"h":3106,"lines":[{"w":0.081391874949137355,"h":0.016300576007987955,"t":"Reading","c":1,"x":0.80051577820157738,"y":0.070574259759002222},{"x":0.06192343618446576,"t":"A more radical strategy is 'combine and transcend\". This entails combining aspects of the","h":0.023066052143909999,"c":1,"y":0.12002148472897645,"w":0.74832143147786467},{"y":0.1406170110766285,"w":0.78771748860677082,"h":0.021522217386396814,"c":1,"t":"product's existing value proposition with attributes addressing changes arising from a trend, to","x":0.063846991819808074},{"w":0.77088597615559906,"c":1,"h":0.022600030254258385,"y":0.16003761287431861,"x":0.063806717248594491,"t":"create a novel experience - one that may land the company in an entirely new market space."},{"t":"At first glance, spending resources to incorporate elements of a seemingly irrelevant trend into","w":0.78947367350260422,"h":0.018997364326668542,"x":0.063909779695825938,"y":0.18158403100547127,"c":1},{"w":0.81217437744140619,"c":1,"h":0.021559136188652017,"t":"one's core offerings sounds like it's hardly worthwhile. But consider Nike's move to integrate the","x":0.063839296947194368,"y":0.19898523719531924},{"x":0.063909765512352792,"h":0.018895348808647294,"t":"digital revolution into its reputation for high-performance athletic footwear. In 2006, they teamed","w":0.81203008015950529,"y":0.21947674396413563,"c":1},{"y":0.23982558140572585,"x":0.065789471247124892,"h":0.019028249741828818,"c":1,"t":"up with technology company Apple to launch Niket, a digital sports kit comprising a sensor","w":0.76879699707031257},{"t":"that attaches to the running shoe and a wireless receiver that connects to the user's iPod. By","y":0.25814467545536668,"x":0.065725948891354066,"w":0.76141423543294273,"h":0.019502184733374284,"c":1},{"x":0.065789471330083032,"c":1,"y":0.27752736611299711,"h":0.018995492594977348,"w":0.80827067057291668,"t":"combining Nike's original value proposition for amateur athletes with one for digital consumers."},{"t":"the Nike+ sports kit and web interface moved the company from a focus on athletic apparel to a","x":0.065712398033526354,"y":0.29723842187163285,"h":0.021979831221482948,"c":1,"w":0.79713180541992201},{"h":0.017487720604949963,"c":1,"t":"new plane of engagement with its customers.","y":0.31831395335238888,"x":0.065789472991684902,"w":0.37969924926757814},{"w":0.79135340372721363,"h":0.018995492594977459,"t":"A third approach, known as 'counteract and reaffirm', involves developing products or services","y":0.3502897618142653,"c":1,"x":0.06766916265194349},{"y":0.36918604646523112,"c":1,"w":0.78947367350260411,"h":0.02038253052190131,"x":0.067669176932908401,"t":"that stress the values traditionally associated with the category in ways that allow consumers to"},{"y":0.3871167500410676,"x":0.067546784535784929,"w":0.77651412963867195,"h":0.023387935955295647,"c":1,"t":"oppose - or at least temporarily escape from - the aspeets of trends they view as undesirable."},{"t":"A product that accomplished this is the ME2, a video game created by Canada's iToys. By","h":0.01747368200318089,"c":1,"x":0.069548877636275014,"y":0.40985189951830814,"w":0.7462405904134114},{"w":0.76895202636718751,"y":0.42729962671402189,"x":0.0676048841952228,"c":1,"t":"reaffirming the toy category's association with physical play. the ME2 counteracted some of","h":0.021776293909941291},{"t":"the widely perceived negative impacts of digital gaming devices. Like other handheld games.","x":0.069548874201209407,"y":0.44752092740587956,"w":0.77443608601888025,"h":0.019048840018602187,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.069548867504865747,"y":0.46802325568317638,"w":0.78759399414062492,"t":"the device featured a host of exciting interactive games, a full-color LCD screen, and advanced","h":0.017488656470795561},{"t":"3D graphics. What set it apart was that it incorporated the traditional physical component","h":0.020807024285782516,"y":0.48515963193555023,"c":1,"x":0.069503465611766638,"w":0.74257705688476561},{"w":0.75563908894856768,"y":0.50579523495480838,"t":"of children's play: it contained a pedometer, which tracked and awarded points for physical","x":0.071428575741826608,"h":0.01899549259497757,"c":1},{"w":0.74831431070963539,"c":1,"y":0.52368788198948268,"x":0.071327115870906913,"h":0.021187397256177021,"t":"activity (walking, running, biking, skateboarding, climbing stairs). The child could use the"},{"y":0.54311047422651471,"h":0.02097835651306823,"c":1,"t":"points to enhance various virtual skills needed for the video game. The ME2, introduced in mid-","w":0.79714492797851577,"x":0.07321206878046449},{"x":0.073308282652463766,"c":1,"y":0.56395348838332637,"w":0.77631576538085934,"t":"2008, catered to kids' huge desire to play video games while countering the negatives, such as","h":0.018895348808647294},{"w":0.38533833821614583,"h":0.019055391693606483,"y":0.58139534861529851,"x":0.073308278565799204,"t":"associations with lack of exercise and obesity.","c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.024097815990755111,"y":0.61289608071716317,"t":"Once you have gained perspective on how trend-related changes in consumer opinions and","x":0.075045771796118474,"w":0.74841929117838546},{"w":0.80107604980468761,"c":1,"y":0.63080517839471006,"h":0.026066722980408352,"t":"behaviors impact on your category, you can determine which of our three innovation strategies to","x":0.075025153656734553},{"c":1,"h":0.020431198002212825,"t":"pursue. When your category's basie valuc proposition continues to be meaningful for consumers","x":0.075187974061977914,"w":0.79887217203776051,"y":0.65406976759474778},{"x":0.075129298646617812,"w":0.74450515747070312,"h":0.022916284132525777,"y":0.67217904405815987,"t":"influenced by the trend, the infuse-and-augment strategy will allow you to reinvigorate the","c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.076917313955870648,"t":"category. If analysis reveals an increasing disparity between your category and consumers' new","w":0.78412531534830743,"y":0.688567077974926,"h":0.024521009122181581},{"c":1,"t":"focus, your innovations need to transcend the category to integrate the two worlds. Finally.","x":0.076927366105448231,"h":0.025422589362857462,"y":0.70753695332638666,"w":0.74649068196614576},{"h":0.024320139396750928,"y":0.72608284047127503,"c":1,"x":0.076901398343515073,"t":"if aspeets of the category clash with undesired outeomes of a trend, such as associations with","w":0.7634867350260417},{"x":0.07877156003419572,"w":0.77855224609374996,"y":0.745377358383297,"h":0.025604717207968197,"c":1,"t":"unhealthy lifestyles, there is an opportunity to counteract those changes by reaffirming the core"},{"y":0.76806662395089897,"c":1,"w":0.20234682718912758,"x":0.078268446996639846,"h":0.026250814669990463,"t":"values of your category."},{"h":0.025472190252673665,"x":0.080666526588525661,"t":"Trends - technological, economic, environmental, social, or political - that affect how people","w":0.7635103861490885,"y":0.79585284787623323,"c":1},{"w":0.78045028686523443,"t":"perceive the world around them and shape what they expect from products and services present","h":0.024254415085909864,"y":0.81449976363862275,"c":1,"x":0.080604382623066143},{"t":"firms with unique opportunitics for growth.","x":0.080657961487927712,"y":0.83701426777726484,"w":0.3593595886230469,"h":0.022110748045381601,"c":1}]}